# Module 8: Weekly Timetable Generator

This is the most critical module.

---

## Inputs

Teacher availability

↓

Teaching assignments

↓

Remaining hours

↓

Blocked periods

↓

Calendar events

---

## Output

Weekly schedule proposal

---

# Scheduling Algorithm

I recommend:

## Phase 1

Greedy Constraint Scheduling

Much easier.

---

Pseudo process:

```text
Sort assignments
By remaining hours DESC

For each assignment

    Find valid slot

        Teacher available

        Teacher not already scheduled

        Class not already scheduled

        Day not blocked

        Period not blocked

    Assign slot

Repeat
```

---

No AI needed.

No genetic algorithm needed initially.

---

# Module 9: Timetable Management

After generation:

Admin sees grid.

Example:

| Time | Mon  | Tue | Wed     |
| ---- | ---- | --- | ------- |
| P1   | Math | DB  | Network |
| P2   | Java | DB  | Math    |

Admin can:

* Drag course
* Move course
* Delete course

---

